    "detailed_description": "<h1>IMPORTANT</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mac/Linux versions have been tested on a limited number of hardware configurations, and performance or compatibility issues may be experienced.</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken in a world where time has collapsed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a fierce warrior from the medieval age\u2014thrust into a nightmarish reality where the past, present, and future collide. One moment you're resting by a campfire, the next you awaken to a twisted landscape of alien warships, research labs, ancient archer towers, streets, and monstrous creatures, alongside the gleaming steel of robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834370/extras/a7d6525af59f50b3765413282c140460.avif?t=1754692690\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing makes sense\u2014and trust is a luxury you can't afford.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even those who seem like allies may turn on you. In this fractured world, deception runs deep and danger wears many faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must fight through this chaotic fusion of timelines. Battle hostile humans, aliens, beasts, and menacing robots across a shattered world that defies logic. As you uncover fragments of truth hidden in this temporal chaos, one question drives you forward:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What tore reality apart\u2014and how can you escape it?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken in a world where time has collapsed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a fierce warrior from the medieval age\u2014thrust into a nightmarish reality where the past, present, and future collide. One moment you're resting by a campfire, the next you awaken to a twisted landscape of alien warships, research labs, ancient archer towers, streets, and monstrous creatures, alongside the gleaming steel of robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834370/extras/a7d6525af59f50b3765413282c140460.avif?t=1754692690\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing makes sense\u2014and trust is a luxury you can't afford.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even those who seem like allies may turn on you. In this fractured world, deception runs deep and danger wears many faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must fight through this chaotic fusion of timelines. Battle hostile humans, aliens, beasts, and menacing robots across a shattered world that defies logic. As you uncover fragments of truth hidden in this temporal chaos, one question drives you forward:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What tore reality apart\u2014and how can you escape it?</p>",
    "short_description": "Chrono Stranded is an adventure action game where you battle through a shattered world where past, present, and future collide. Survive encounters against humans, aliens, beasts, and robots as you uncover the truth behind a cataclysmic temporal collapse.",
